@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

state AccountCreationState
state LoggedInState
state VideoViewingState(PausedState, PlayingState)
state LikesListState
state DiscussionState

[*] --> AccountCreationState

AccountCreationState --> LoggedInState : CreateAccountEvent
AccountCreationState --> LoggedInState : LoginEvent
LoggedInState --> AccountCreationState : LogoutEvent

VideoViewingState --> VideoViewingState : VideoEndEvent
VideoViewingState --> LikesListState : SaveVideoEvent
LikesListState --> VideoViewingState : ViewLikesListEvent

LoggedInState --> DiscussionState : EnterDiscussionEvent
DiscussionState --> LoggedInState

@enduml
